  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:01.263" end="00:06.585" ttm:agent="v1">Yo! Hello!</p>
      <p begin="00:06.585" end="00:14.585" ttm:agent="v1">Gun shot, gun shot</p>
      <p begin="00:15.161" end="00:16.743" ttm:agent="v1">Blood clot bun 'em like Sprite</p>
      <p begin="00:16.743" end="00:18.577" ttm:agent="v1">Yo, bredren, gwan pass me the light</p>
      <p begin="00:18.577" end="00:20.444" ttm:agent="v1">Real general, real cannibal</p>
      <p begin="00:20.444" end="00:22.279" ttm:agent="v1">Real taliban pon my side</p>
      <p begin="00:22.279" end="00:24.011" ttm:agent="v1">Them bwoy dem nah like me 'cause me a teif wife</p>
      <p begin="00:24.011" end="00:25.933" ttm:agent="v1">Them bwoy dem nah like me 'cause me a take life</p>
      <p begin="00:25.933" end="00:27.796" ttm:agent="v1">Real life we a bubble, Red Stripe</p>
      <p begin="00:27.796" end="00:29.663" ttm:agent="v1">Why pree? Hello!</p>
      <p begin="00:29.663" end="00:31.496" ttm:agent="v1">Put yo' hands in the air, this ain't a toast</p>
      <p begin="00:31.496" end="00:33.399" ttm:agent="v1">This a robbery, bitch, ain't tryna boast</p>
      <p begin="00:33.399" end="00:35.264" ttm:agent="v1">Know they sick of me, bitch, I do the most</p>
      <p begin="00:35.264" end="00:37.049" ttm:agent="v1">Take a look at these diamonds, they kinda gross</p>
      <p begin="00:37.049" end="00:38.787" ttm:agent="v1">Take a look at yo' self, you kinda gross</p>
      <p begin="00:38.787" end="00:40.700" ttm:agent="v1">Swinging the pendulum, bitch, I'm on a boat</p>
      <p begin="00:40.700" end="00:42.500" ttm:agent="v1">I hope you choke, throw up and then croak</p>
      <p begin="00:42.500" end="00:45.478" ttm:agent="v1">Wishing he would, like he made of oak</p>
      <p begin="00:45.478" end="00:49.030" ttm:agent="v1">Hello! Yo!</p>
      <p begin="00:49.030" end="00:52.846" ttm:agent="v1">Why pree?</p>
      <p begin="00:52.846" end="00:56.361" ttm:agent="v1">You see me? What you mean?</p>
      <p begin="00:56.361" end="00:58.713" ttm:agent="v1">Blood cot, gun shot, yo</p>
      <p begin="00:58.713" end="01:00.213" ttm:agent="v1">Mi aguh shell him ends, weh di Benz?</p>
      <p begin="01:00.194" end="01:02.280" ttm:agent="v1">Weh di TEC? a revenge we nuh walk wid nuh belt</p>
      <p begin="01:02.280" end="01:05.932" ttm:agent="v1">Esyde' chop off yuh Head widi led, you a beg, sinner death, hollow point inna chest</p>
      <p begin="01:05.932" end="01:09.649" ttm:agent="v1">Gunshot, shell him head like-ah egg, we defend wid the riffle, nuh play pon nuh bench</p>
      <p begin="01:09.649" end="01:11.484" ttm:agent="v1">Esyde' slap off yuh face and we leff</p>
      <p begin="01:11.484" end="01:13.250" ttm:agent="v1">Alien, NASA have-fi fraid when we step</p>
      <p begin="01:13.250" end="01:16.798" ttm:agent="v1">The bwoy dem a follow mi, wanna be badda me, affi show say dem a one a me chatter nuh badda me</p>
      <p begin="01:16.798" end="01:20.678" ttm:agent="v1">Roll wid-eh AK and the dramatic badda mi, mi mek the six pants kick dem like ibrahimović</p>
      <p begin="01:20.678" end="01:22.577" ttm:agent="v1">Gunshot, daggering inna another skin</p>
      <p begin="01:22.577" end="01:24.411" ttm:agent="v1">Bayshot spray out, somethin' like-ah piss</p>
      <p begin="01:24.411" end="01:26.243" ttm:agent="v1">Blood pon the main-road nothing like-ah drinks</p>
      <p begin="01:26.243" end="01:28.056" ttm:agent="v1">Chop off yuh head wid shot like bin</p>
      <p begin="01:28.056" end="01:29.556" ttm:agent="v1">Bin</p>
      <p begin="01:28.261" end="01:30.132" ttm:agent="v1">Dem' delicate yuh pretend fi dread</p>
      <p begin="01:30.132" end="01:31.706" ttm:agent="v1">Till the riffle a beat inna yuh head</p>
      <p begin="01:31.706" end="01:33.397" ttm:agent="v1">Esyde, lock off the road wid the TEC</p>
      <p begin="01:33.397" end="01:36.346" ttm:agent="v1">Make the cops have-fi lock off the road to them ends</p>
      <p begin="01:36.346" end="01:37.915" ttm:agent="v1">Blood clot bun 'em like Sprite</p>
      <p begin="01:37.915" end="01:39.801" ttm:agent="v1">Yo, bredren, gwan pass me the light</p>
      <p begin="01:39.801" end="01:41.647" ttm:agent="v1">Real general, real cannibal</p>
      <p begin="01:41.647" end="01:43.414" ttm:agent="v1">Real taliban pon my side</p>
      <p begin="01:43.414" end="01:45.298" ttm:agent="v1">Them bwoy dem nah like me 'cause me a teif wife</p>
      <p begin="01:45.298" end="01:47.249" ttm:agent="v1">Them bwoy dem nah like me 'cause me a take life</p>
      <p begin="01:47.249" end="01:49.115" ttm:agent="v1">Real life we a bubble, Red Stripe</p>
      <p begin="01:49.115" end="01:51.970" ttm:agent="v1">Why pree? Hello!</p>
      <p begin="01:51.970" end="01:55.471" ttm:agent="v1">Hello! Yo!</p>
      <p begin="01:55.471" end="01:59.356" ttm:agent="v1">Why pree?</p>
      <p begin="01:59.356" end="02:02.892" ttm:agent="v1">You see me? What ya mean?</p>
      <p begin="02:02.892" end="02:06.892" ttm:agent="v1">Blood cot, gun shot, yo</p>
    </div>
